    </div>
    <div class="wd-preview-tui-prompt"><span>visitor@webdecor:~ $</span><span>open studies_</span></div>
    <div class="wd-preview-tui-keybar"><span>Alt 1–6 / open file</span><span>Ctrl K / command</span><span>? / help</span></div>
  </>}
  {slug==='weird-internet'&&<><img class="wd-preview-wallpaper" src="/images/xp-wallpaper.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy"/><div class="wd-preview-icons"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 40 32"><path d="M2 8V3h14l5 5h17v22H2z" fill="#ffdf75" stroke="#91632f"/><path d="M2 12h36l-4 18H2z" fill="#ffe99c" stroke="#91632f"/></svg>Design studies</span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="3" width="28" height="22" fill="#e7e7e7" stroke="#555"/><rect x="8" y="6" width="20" height="15" fill="#245edb"/><path d="M13 26h10v6H13zM8 33h20" stroke="#e7e7e7" stroke-width="3"/></svg>The internet</span></div><div class="wd-preview-os-window"><div class="wd-preview-os-title">Welcome to WebDECOR XP<span><Icon name="minus"/><Icon name="maximize"/><Icon name="close"/></span></div><div class="wd-preview-os-body"><span>wd.</span><b>The internet<br/>should be weirder.</b><img src="/images/crt-monitor.webp" alt="" width="1280" height="1280" loading="lazy"/><small>Independent minds. Unexpected websites.</small></div></div><div class="wd-preview-taskbar"><span>start</span><span>WebDECOR XP</span><span>09:41</span></div></>}
  <svg class="wd-preview-register" viewBox="0 0 1000 840" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none"><path d="M30 3H3v27M970 3h27v27M3 810v27h27M997 810v27h-27M485 3h30M500 3v8M485 837h30M500 829v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg>
</div>
